    narr:narration """This hub covers the decision to adopt Zypherion as purpose-built columnar analytics infrastructure, replacing general-purpose tooling. The [performance-driven adoption rationale](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#AnalyticsDatabaseAdoption) frames the shift as an order-of-magnitude improvement play. QuintonFairweather's statements, dated 20260717, form a tight cluster: [the adoption commitment](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) names Zypherion explicitly, [the performance claim](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) anchors it to a 15x columnar-query speedup, and [the timeline declaration](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) places migration start next quarter — resolved by [a restatement](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6) to Q3 2026. Two further restatements consolidate the [database selection](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) and [performance figure](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5) as Quinton's principal-attributed record. No dissent, qualification, or alternative vendor appears in this graph.""" ;
