    narr:variation [ narr:text "The timeline is stated two ways — 'next quarter' (vague, pressure-register) vs. 'Q3 2026' (pinned) — leaving open whether these are equivalent or whether the restatement introduced specificity not in the original." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6> ] ;
